message: "If you use this reference implementation, please cite the accompanying article."
title: "agent-harness: Cross-Layer Observability for LLM-Assisted Test Automation"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the cross-layer agent harness pattern: a
  TypeScript framework coupling an authoring layer (LLM coding assistant),
  an operating layer (five-agent SDLC pipeline over MCP), and an execution
  layer (three hardware tiers with intelligent self-healing) through a
  shared observability substrate. Includes the §6.1 live-LLM evaluation
  artifacts (results.json, 24-image visual corpus, audit packet, LLM-as-a-Judge
  visual-assertion service with seeded ground-truth validation at Cohen's
  kappa = 0.667 substantial).
